pen-plan kitchen, living and dining","53e71389d3bc",[178],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":179,"_155":180},[],"Premium bathrooms with quality fixtures","a56feefc4804",[184],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":185,"_155":186},[],"Tiled flooring throughout living areas","84375ecf30ce",[190],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":191,"_155":192},[],"Designer kitchen with stone benchtops","2354d8b33592",[196],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":197,"_155":198},[],"Refrigerated heating and cooling","89cc6c9d9f60",[202],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":203,"_155":204},[],"Contemporary architectural façade","a98313c1dea2",[208],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":209,"_155":210},[],"Feature cathedral ceiling","1305b6c70db4",[214],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":215,"_155":216},[],"Completed in just 3 months","e78f3fe8b087",[220],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":221,"_155":222},[],"Built on a compact 240sqm allotment","86cd1d0f95a9",[226],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":227,"_155":228},[],"Approximately 205sqm (22 Squares) custom residence","ff4b3e2b5912",[233],[],"h3",{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":234,"_155":235},[],"Key Features","782d0c018f67",[239],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":240,"_155":241},[],"Through intelligent design, efficient project management and close coordination with trades, Siari Build successfully delivered a spacious and functional custom home in just three months. Open-plan living, quality materials and carefully selected finishes create a modern residence that offers exceptional value while exceeding the client’s expectations.","a3c6f6928eef",[245],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":246,"_155":247},[],"Our Solution","a0f37d40bcae",[251],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":252,"_155":253},[],"Designing a comfortable family home on a compact 240sqm block required careful planning to maximise internal living space while maintaining a practical layout, natural light and street appeal. The objective was to create a home that felt significantly larger than its footprint while delivering premium finishes within an efficient construction timeframe.","18576792e97c",[257],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":258,"_155":259},[],"The Challenge","46168750c9d6",[263],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":264,"_155":265},[],"Completed in just three months, the project demonstrates Siari Build’s ability to deliver high-quality homes efficiently without compromising craftsmanship or attention to detail.","a1e241a503c7",[269],[],{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":270,"_155":271},[],"The Tarneit Cathedral Residence is a contemporary custom home designed to maximise space, natural light and functionality on a compact 240sqm allotment. Despite the site’s size, this 22-square residence delivers a spacious and modern family environment through clever design, quality finishes and efficient use of every square metre.","a3c9646c59f8",[276],[],"h2",{"_136":151,"_138":152,"_153":277,"_155":278},[],"Overview",{"_280":281,"_282":283},"settings",{"_325":326,"_327":328,"_329":330,"_331":332,"_333":287,"_334":335,"_336":-5,"_337":338,"_339":287,"_340":-5,"_341":-5,"_342":-5,"_343":344,"_345":346,"_347":-5,"_348":349,"_350":351,"_352":353,"_354":355,"_356":357},"navigation",{"_284":285,"_286":287,"_288":289,"_290":291},"footerMenu",[318,319,320,321,322],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[303,304,305,306],"socialMenu",[292,293,294],{"_295":-5,"_296":301,"_98":302},{"_295":-5,"_296":299,"_98":300},{"_295":-5,"_296":297,"_98":298},"icon","label","Hauzz","http://houzz.com","Instagram","http://insta.com","Facebook","http:\\\\facebook.com",{"_296":-5,"_308":316,"_310":317},{"_296":-5,"_308":314,"_310":315},{"_296":-5,"_308":312,"_310":313},{"_296":307,"_308":309,"_310":311},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_296":-5,"_308":316,"_310":317},{"_296":-5,"_308":314,"_310":315},{"_296":-5,"_308":312,"_310":313},{"_296":-5,"_308":309,"_310":311},{"_296":-5,"_308":323,"_310":324},"privacy-policy","Priv